1.4.6.2 Cubicles for ambulant disabled people 
For people using crutches or with other mobility impairment cubicles with a larger 
than standard clear activity or manoeuvring space and grab rails will be more 
accessible. 
Where cubicles for ambulant disabled people are provided: 
 The width of the cubicle should be between 800 mm and 900 mm; 
 The WC should be centrally located on the back wall; 
 An activity space of 750 mm (clear of the door swing) should be provided as 
per Diagram 19b);

